{"id":"wb-5-75","name":"古荥冶铁遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"荥阳故城","text":"荥阳故城位于河南省郑州市惠济区古荥镇，为汉代城市遗址。荥阳故城北依邙岭，山北为黄河，东面是历史上的鸿沟，南面是索须河。2001年，古荥冶铁遗址被列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。2006年，荥阳故城被列入全国重点文物保护单位，与古荥冶铁遗址合并，并称荥阳故城。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8D%A5%E9%98%B3%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":87871525,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87871525","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2c9fe3935c217771230bca97.jpg","title":"20240929_Site_of_Ancient_Xingyang_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240929_Site_of_Ancient_Xingyang_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/20240929_Site_of_Ancient_Xingyang_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​郑州荥阳故城西城墙","width":320,"height":213}}